{"ticker":"TYL","updated":"2026-10-30T23:19:02Z","profile":{"longName":"Tyler Technologies, Inc.","shortName":"Tyler Technologies, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.tylertech.com","fullTimeEmployees":7972,"marketCap":15677179904,"trailingPE":49.225964,"forwardPE":25.420195,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.3180194,"pegRatio":1.56,"targetMeanPrice":435.22726,"targetHighPrice":525.0,"targetLowPrice":345.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.087,"earningsGrowth":0.207,"grossMargins":0.47702998,"operatingMargins":0.18073,"profitMargins":0.13512999,"totalRevenue":2481344000,"beta":0.849,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":483.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":270.71,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Tyler Technologies, Inc. provides integrated software and technology management solutions for the public sector in the United States. It operates in two segments, Enterprise Software and Platform Technologies. The company designs, develops, markets, and supports a range of software solutions to serve mission-critical back-office functions. It also offers platform and transformative technology solutions, such as cybersecurity services, including threat detection, response, vulnerability testing, and security training, data and insights, digital solutions, payments, platform technologies, and outdoor recreation solutions; public administration solutions, including civic services, ERP, property and recording, and regulatory; and corrections, courts and justice, and public safety solutions. In addition, the company provides school ERP and student transportation K-12 education solutions; and health and human services solutions comprising environmental health, and disability and benefits. It has a strategic collaboration agreement with Amazon Web Services for cloud hosting services. The company was formerly known as Tyler Corporation and changed its name to Tyler Technologies, Inc. in June 1999. Tyler Technologies, Inc. was founded in 1966 and is based in Plano, Texas.","summary_zh":"Tyler Technologies, Inc. 為美國公共部門提供整合軟體和技術管理解決方案。它分為兩個部門：企業軟體部門和平台技術部門。該公司設計、開發、行銷和支援一系列軟體解決方案，為關鍵任務的後台功能提供服務。它還提供平台和變革性技術解決方案，例如網路安全服務，包括威脅檢測、回應、漏洞測試和安全培訓、數據和見解、數位解決方案、支付、平台技術和戶外休閒解決方案；公共管理解決方案，包括公民服務、ERP、財產和記錄以及監管；和懲戒、法院和司法以及公共安全解決方案。此外，公司還提供學校ERP和學生交通K-12教育解決方案；健康和人類服務解決方案，包括環境健康、殘疾和福利。它與亞馬遜網路服務公司就雲端託管服務達成了策略合作協議。該公司前身為 Tyler Corporation，並於 1999 年 6 月更名為 Tyler Technologies, Inc.。 Tyler Technologies, Inc. 成立於 1966 年，總部位於德州普萊諾。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":555.24,"h":560.17,"l":548.4,"c":552.49,"v":280300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":551.7,"h":554.14,"l":549.29,"c":553.83,"v":168800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":553.09,"h":554.53,"l":546.41,"c":554.23,"v":403900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":557.72,"h":561.02,"l":553.08,"c":559.96,"v":174400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":559.96,"h":566.58,"l":558.24,"c":566.1,"v":233900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":566.34,"h":566.34,"l":554.47,"c":558.41,"v":250800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":557.01,"h":558.49,"l":543.68,"c":545.91,"v":279600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":552.4,"h":555.52,"l":548.25,"c":553.99,"v":301600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":553.19,"h":553.19,"l":544.5,"c":544.99,"v":277800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":544.99,"h":547.93,"l":532.47,"c":539.46,"v":400300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":540.11,"h":541.29,"l":532.9,"c":534.67,"v":246900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":537.32,"h":543.3,"l":532.19,"c":536.38,"v":296000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":535.27,"h":540.62,"l":528.09,"c":530.05,"v":364800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":530.78,"h":537.64,"l":529.51,"c":534.32,"v":995800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":531.8,"h":538.79,"l":530.51,"c":536.16,"v":277700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":536.62,"h":538.9,"l":527.23,"c":528.39,"v":323500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":528.98,"h":530.79,"l":521.08,"c":522.89,"v":383900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":522.0,"h":526.6,"l":516.77,"c":522.22,"v":289000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":524.35,"h":531.53,"l":520.95,"