k5PeWRVUXFuQllxN1dLWi05RU9mRnFXeEUxdTRmY2M?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"泰勒科技 (NYSE:TYL) 發布 2026 財年獲利指引"},{"title":"Teleconferência de Resultados do 3º Trimestre de 2026 da Tyler Technologies (TYL): Crescimento do SaaS, Migração para a Nuvem e IA","src":"TradingKey","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5JNWVQRXpNOU00M3dqNGF4QzNjbG5PQm1aWXE1UENWTlVUMFkxTTV3MGxUZ0c2ak1SQWNCMWRSZ2l6cGZzZWlQYl9yR0RIcVF5NFNVUmNNeFh2dnpuT1p1U3dPd1pWd3V6?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Tyler Technologies (TYL) 2026 年三季成果電話會議：SaaS、Nuvem 和 IA 遷移的進展"},{"title":"Tyler Technologies Earnings Call Highlights Cloud, AI Push","src":"TipRanks","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOZm1OSV95TmhjdV9OWlJvUm85dlh0eUhMbEViTS1QaEhTM2Y4LThaZkYyUTNDRFRFMENJc1pXbzR2bUR0REZhTVNTQTRMWW9LNklYZG9Fd2NrNDNIRTBEWlZKVDJwS0ZFcGVYTEFkemd6WWJuNUJmNXhiVXg1dFFvbkd1Vl9IWVRLTndBYXkyOGhLck56eDkwbmlfYjdSYXJCNDJjclZQQm16ZlJHRFE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Tyler Technologies 財報電話會議重點介紹雲端和人工智慧的推動"},{"title":"[Tyler Technologies Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Tyler Technologies Q3: Record $277M Free Cash Flow, SaaS Revenue Up 21.2%, But High-End SaaS Guidance Trimmed on Deal Timing","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE9xaER5WEFiYjhMNEI5VWRMenZ2clpZckJMMWt3Vzl0RXctaW5kS0NmaGRjNndLNGVoSE5UeW84MkZpdnpqbV93OXJkWUx6S1c4WFFZOUtHcmRNcWhy?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[Tyler Technologies 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] Tyler Technologies 第三季：自由現金流創紀錄的 2.77 億美元，SaaS 營收成長 21.2%，但高階 SaaS 指引因交易時機而調整"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":11},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":6},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/860731/000086073126000016/tyl-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Tyler Technologies, Inc. (\"Tyler\" or \"Company\") is a leading provider of integrated software and technology management solutions for the public sector. Our solutions empower local, state, and federal government entities to create smarter, safer, and stronger communities. We offer the broadest range of software solutions and services designed for every level of public sector government agency. Our solutions deliver mission-critical technology to support the essential functions of government, including public safety, justice, public health, taxation and budgeting, infrastructure and land use, outdoor recreation, utility and civic services, regulation, K-12 education, and social services. We provide both the back-office systems-of-record that serve the operational needs of specific government agencies, as well as platform technology solutions that are designed to integrate with our back-off","zh":"Tyler Technologies, Inc.（「泰勒」或「公司」）是一家為公共部門提供整合軟體和技術管理解決方案的領先供應商。我們的解決方案使地方、州和聯邦政府實體能夠創造更聰明、更安全、更強大的社區。我們提供最廣泛的軟體解決方案和服務，專為各級公共部門政府機構設計。我們的解決方案提供關鍵任務技術來支持政府的基本功能，包括公共安全、司法、公共衛生、稅收和預算、基礎設施和土地使用、戶外休閒、公用事業和公民服務、監管、K-12 教育和社會服務。我們提供滿足特定政府機構營運需求的後台記錄系統，以及旨在與我們的回退整合的平台技術解決方案"},{"en":"We maintain deep, long-term relationships with state and local government agencies, including dedicated state-level offices in the 30 states in which we have enterprise contracts. Our professional information technology (\"IT\") services include cloud-based software deployment, data conversion, and training. We also provide continuing client support services to ensure product performance and reliability, providing us with long-term client relationships and a significant base of recurring revenue.","zh":"我們與州和地方政府機構保持著深入、長期的合作關係，其中包括我們在 30 個州與企業簽訂了合約的專門州級辦事處。我们的专业資訊技术（“IT”）服务包括基于云的软件部署、数据转换和培训。我們還提供持續的客戶支援服務，以確保產品性能和可靠性，為我們提供長期的客戶關係和重要的經常性收入基礎。"},{"en":"The federal, state, and local public sector market is one of the largest and most decentralized IT markets in the country, consisting of hundreds of federal agencies, all 50 states, approximately 3,000 counties, 36,000 cities and towns, and 12,600 school districts. This market is also comprised of approximately 40,000 special districts and other agencies, each with specialized delegated responsibilities and unique information management requirements.","zh":"聯邦、州和地方公共部門市場是美國最大、最分散的 IT 市場之一，由數百個聯邦機構、所有 50 個州、大約 3,000 個縣、36,000 個城鎮以及 12,600 個學區組成。该市场还由大约 40,000 个特区和其他机构组成，每个机构都有专门的委派职责和独特的資訊管理要求。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We provide a comprehensive and flexible suite of products and services that addresses the information technology needs of cities, counties, states, schools, federal agencies, and other government entities.","zh":"我們提供全面且靈活的產品和服務套件，可滿足城市、縣、州、學校、聯邦機構和其他政府實體的資訊科技需求。"},{"en":"We design, develop, market, and support a broad range of software solutions to serve mission-critical \"back-office\" functions of the public sector. Many of our back-office software applications integrate with our transformative platform solutions, such as our unified payments platform, data and insights platform, and digital public engagement solutions that allow for real-time public access to a variety of information or that allow the public to transact business with governments online.","zh":"我们设计、开发、营销和支持广泛的软件解决方案，为公共部门的关键任务“后台”功能提供服务。我們的許多後台軟體應用程式都與我們的變革性平台解決方案集成，例如我們的統一支付平台、數據和見解平台以及數位公眾參與解決方案，這些解決方案允許公眾即時存取各種資訊或允許公眾與政府在線進行業務交易。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with numerous local, regional, and national firms that provide or offer some or many of the same solutions and services that we provide. Many of these competitors are smaller companies that may offer less expensive solutions than ours. Many of these firms operate within a specific geographic area and/or in a narrow product or service niche. We also compete with national firms, some of which have greater financial and technical resources than we do, including Oracle Corporation, Infor, SAP AG, Workday, Inc., CentralSquare Technologies, Thomson Reuters Corporation, Motorola Solutions, Inc., Axon Enterprise, Inc., and Constellation Software, Inc. In addition, we sometimes compete with consulting and systems integration firms, which develop custom systems, primarily for larger governments. We also occasionally compete with central internal information service departments of govern","zh":"我們與許多本地、區域和國家公司競爭，這些公司提供或提供與我們提供的部分或許多相同的解決方案和服務。这些竞争对手中有许多是规模较小的公司，它们可能提供比我们更便宜的解决方案。其中許多公司在特定地理區域和/或狹窄的產品或服務領域運作。我們也與國內公司競爭，其中一些公司比我們擁有更多的財務和技術資源，包括甲骨文公司、Infor、SAP AG、Workday, Inc.、CentralSquare Technologies、湯森路透公司、摩托羅拉解決方案公司、Axon Enterprise, Inc.和Constellation Software, Inc.。此外，我們有時與諮詢和系統整合公司競爭，這些公司主要為較大的政府開發客製化系統。我們偶爾也會與政府中央內部資訊服務部門競爭"},{"en":"We compete on a variety of factors, including price, service, name recognition, reputation, technological capabilities, and the ability to configure products and services to address the individual requirements of the client. Our ability to offer an integrated system of applications for several offices or departments is often a competitive advantage. Governmental units often are required to seek competitive proposals through a request for proposal process, and some prospective clients use consultants to assist them with the proposal and vendor selection process.","zh":"我們在多種因素上競爭，包括價格、服務、知名度、聲譽、技術能力以及配置產品和服務以滿足客戶個性化需求的能力。我們為多個辦事處或部門提供整合應用程式系統的能力通常是一種競爭優勢。政府單位通常需要透過徵求建議書流程來尋求競爭性建議書，一些潛在客戶會聘請顧問來協助他們完成建議書和供應商選擇過程。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Enterprise Software","val":1694421000,"zh":"企業軟體部門"},{"name":"Platform Technologies","val":628554000,"zh":"平台技術部門"}],"total":2332340000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":1586203000,"zh":"認購及流通"},{"name":"Maintenance","val":445614000,"zh":"維護"},{"name":"Professional Services","val":242700000,"zh":"專業服務"},{"name":"Hardware & Other","val":45007000,"zh":"硬體及其他"},{"name":"Software Licenses & Royalties","val":12816000,"zh":"軟體許可和版稅"}],"total":2332340000}},"peers":["ROP","IT","WST","PTC","VRSK"]}}